{
  "_readme": [
    "WP7 (C8 D29c): the catalogue installed (v1) apps saw before WP7, for the cards whose v1-visible caps WP7 changed.",
    "Built from a transform-only preview of the WP7 base (commit 06fdd59, its loader and override files) with the v1 feed filters of v_card_catalogue_export: reward rules with min_engine_version 1 and rule_role other than info; caps with min_engine_version 1 whose rule and targets are all such rules. Trimmed to the fields the v1 engines read.",
    "api/test/card_worked_examples.test.js replays a month of spends through the v1 engine on these cards and on the v1 view of the current snapshots, and fails if v1 ever pays more now than before WP7."
  ],
